{"total_count":1598,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3","id":3568021352,"node_id":"I_kwDOQLu5pc7Uq69o","number":3,"title":"Slippage Sentinel","user":{"login":"ponderingdemocritus","id":90423308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDIzMzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90423308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus","html_url":"https://github.com/ponderingdemocritus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9550858602,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJag","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550858603,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJaw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/defi","name":"defi","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550859097,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaLWQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/risk-management","name":"risk-management","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550883116,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUbpLA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/$1000","name":"$1000","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":100,"created_at":"2025-10-29T21:45:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:56:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Purpose\nEstimate safe slippage tolerance for any route to prevent swap reverts.\n\n## Specification\n\n**Job:** Suggest safe slippage for a specific swap route.\n\n**Inputs:**\n- `token_in` - Input token address\n- `token_out` - Output token address\n- `amount_in` - Amount to swap\n- `route_hint` - Suggested route/DEX\n\n**Returns:**\n- `min_safe_slip_bps` - Minimum safe slippage in basis points\n- `pool_depths` - Liquidity depth data for route\n- `recent_trade_size_p95` - 95th percentile of recent trade sizes\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n✅ Slippage suggestion prevents revert for 95% of test swaps  \n✅ Accounts for pool depth and recent volatility  \n✅ **Must be deployed on a domain and reachable via x402**\n\n## Done When\nAgent provides slippage recommendations that demonstrably reduce swap failures.\n\n---\n\n## Basic Example\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { createAgentApp } from \"@lucid-dreams/agent-kit\";\n\nconst { app, addEntrypoint } = createAgentApp({\n  name: \"slippage-sentinel\",\n  version: \"0.1.0\",\n  description: \"Estimate safe slippage tolerance for any route\",\n});\n\naddEntrypoint({\n  key: \"echo\",\n  description: \"Echo a message\",\n  input: z.object({ text: z.string() }),\n  async handler({ input }) {\n    return {\n      output: { text: String(input.text ?? \"\") },\n      usage: { total_tokens: String(input.text ?? \"\").length },\n    };\n  },\n});\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n- [@lucid-dreams/agent-kit](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@lucid-dreams/agent-kit)\n\n## Submission\n**Submission is a PR into this repo linking the issue - first in first served if the bounty has been completed**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994","id":3284720071,"node_id":"I_kwDOASMt287DyNnH","number":2994,"title":"[BOUNTY] RCS Support [14999$]","user":{"login":"unpluggederan","id":116825601,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvaeAQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116825601?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan","html_url":"https://github.com/unpluggederan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unpluggederan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":94622516,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NDYyMjUxNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"9C27B0","default":true,"description":null},{"id":431160732,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MzExNjA3MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"129e5e","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":563,"created_at":"2025-08-01T18:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:40:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Feature Description:**\nGoogle Messages is currently the only widely available RCS client for Android. When attempting to use Google Messages with microG, users typically encounter issues such as:\n\nA persistent message stating \"RCS chats aren't available for this device.\"\nAn indefinite \"Setting up...\", where authentication of the phone number never completes.\n\nRecent developments suggest that Google Messages no longer strictly requires device attestation for RCS, making it possible to enable RCS functionality with microG. However, it appears there's a missing component or necessary adjustment within microG itself preventing successful setup.\n\nGoogle has effectively monopolized RCS, despite it being a GSMA-backed standard intended as a successor to SMS. Unlike SMS, RCS has become a closed ecosystem under Google's control, restricting open interoperability and limiting choice for users and developers. RCS has seen significant adoption, particularly in North America, and recently Apple added support RCS, further increasing its importance as a messaging standard.\n\n**Requested Solution**\n\nProvide a solution that enables Google Messages to successfully connect to and use RCS functionality when operating with microG. Acceptable outcomes include:\n- A fix or enhancement to microG itself, allowing seamless RCS connectivity.\n- Compatibility with recent versions of Google Messages is desired. Solutions that only support a specific Google Messages version from the past year will be awarded half of the bounty amount.\n- Modifications to AOSP or additional permissions changes are acceptable.\n- The solution must work on devices with a locked bootloader.\n\nLimitations\nSolutions relying on rooting, Magisk, or similar root-based tools are not acceptable.\n\n**Additional Information**\n\nGrapheneOS users, who leverage a Play services sandbox, have reported success with enabling RCS by applying permission changes. Although their setup differs from microG, the discussions that were taken in this thread (especially in the last year) may offer valuable insights for this bounty: https://discuss.grapheneos.org/d/1353-using-rcs-with-google-messages-on-grapheneos\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/reactions","total_count":70,"+1":35,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":22,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":5,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microg/GmsCore/issues/2994/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94716","id":4753538715,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABG1U-mw","number":94716,"title":"[$250] Magic Code- A second magic code is sent after offline reload","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2MTAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/External","name":"External","color":"a7b8ef","default":false,"description":"Added to denote the issue can be worked on by a contributor"},{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNDU1ODI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Daily","name":"Daily","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":3136662525,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTM2NjYyNTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Help%20Wanted","name":"Help Wanted","color":"CFC8F1","default":false,"description":"Apply this label when an issue is open to proposals by contributors"},{"id":4664850679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFgv49w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"huult","id":20178761,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTc4NzYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20178761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult","html_url":"https://github.com/huult","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":45,"created_at":"2026-06-26T16:28:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:38:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"huult","id":20178761,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTc4NzYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20178761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult","html_url":"https://github.com/huult","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.20-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/93301\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Windows 10\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition: User has not validate account yet\n\n1. While online, go to Wallet > Add bank account\n2. Reach the magic-code screen so a code is requested. Verify a code is received and the countdown starts.\n2. Go offline. Verify the countdown timer is hidden and the Verify / \"didn't receive a code\" controls are disabled.\n3. Within 30 seconds of having opened the screen, reload the page (while still offline)\n4. Go back online. Verify no duplicate magic-code email/SMS is sent as a result of the offline reload.\nResult: When the app reconnects after the page is reloaded while offline, a second magic code is sent.\n\n## Expected Result:\nAfter reloading the page while offline and then reconnecting, no additional magic code should be sent.\n\n## Actual Result:\nWhen the app reconnects after the page is reloaded while offline, a second magic code is sent. The second code is different from the original\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bce8557-22b2-4fe8-a8e5-ea4974f8ad6d\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7192060\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070546671400353651\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070546671400353651</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070546671400353651</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @huult</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93832","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93832/labels{/name}","comments_