/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3","id":4148310577,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjIx","number":3,"title":"[BOUNTY $100] HOOK: Pre-tool-use hook that blocks destructive bash commands","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402677,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e19Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/hook","name":"hook","color":"DC2626","default":false,"description":"Claude Code hook"},{"id":10532402829,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e2jQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/security","name":"security","color":"B91C1C","default":false,"description":"Security-related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1356,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $100 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate a Claude Code `pre-tool-use` hook in Python or bash that intercepts\ndangerous bash commands before they are executed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Hook follows Claude Code hooks format (`~/.claude/hooks/`)\n- [ ] Blocks these patterns: `rm -rf`, `DROP TABLE`, `git push --force`,\n      `TRUNCATE`, `DELETE FROM` without a WHERE clause\n- [ ] Logs every blocked attempt to `~/.claude/hooks/blocked.log`\n      with: timestamp, attempted command, project path\n- [ ] Displays a clear message to Claude explaining why the command was blocked\n- [ ] Does not interfere with normal bash commands\n- [ ] README with installation in 2 commands or fewer\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with the hook + README\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Resources\n- Claude Code hooks docs: https://docs.anthropic.com/claude-code/hooks","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus