thub.com/users/truph01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/truph01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/truph01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.64-13\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** EDGE case. Issue to retest: https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/62222\nInternal issue: https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/507014\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Windows 11 / Chrome, iPhone 13 / iOS 26.5, Samsung Galaxy A52 / Android 14\n**App Component:** Search\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions:\n- Logged in to a user that has some expenses\nSteps:\n1.Go to Spend > Expense\n2. Click advance filters\n3. Select From an account that you're logged in (yourself) > save the search > click view results\n4. Go to search bar\n5. Add query in the existing input \"group-by: reports\" and ente\n6. Click advance filters and select save\n\n## Expected Result:\ntyping \"group-by: reports\" should show expected result and \"from\" filter remains applied\n\n## Actual Result:\nError occurs after adding \"group-by: reports\" to the search query and \"from\" filter disappear\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c83c3c6-17e0-4d75-b5a8-1ce0a54365fc\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022054389470496700909</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2054389470496700909</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92364","id":4571677482,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEH5DKg","number":92364,"title":"[$250] Concierge options loads every time when choose an option","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5