 and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/92254\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** kiatest.80+ck611264@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** iPhone 16/18.7.1 Pixel 8a/Android 16\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition:\n1.\"Track expenses for my business\" selected during onboarding.\n2. Account has at least one workspace.\n3. Approvals and payments disabled.\n\n1. Launch Hybrid app\n2. Navigate to \"Reports\" > \"Expenses\"\n3. Turn off internet connection.\n4. Create a manual expense and submit it to workspace.\nVerify that expense is created while on \"Expenses\" section while offline, action button on preview, should display \"Done\", if workspace has approvals and payments disabled.\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe expense is created while on \"Expenses\" section while offline, action button on preview, should display \"Done\", if workspace has approvals and payments disabled.\n\n## Actual Result:\nAction button shown as \"Draft\" instead of \"Done\" for offline expense when approvals/payments are disabled\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3af50b0c-016f-4298-99a9-0c2ca43263b0\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fa682fd-9f27-4d15-905b-e2b8b79b6cc9\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7178469\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065264296842947325\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065264296842947325</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065264296842947325</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @luacmartins</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93371/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/66411","id":3237323991,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7A9aTX","number":66411,"title":"[Partial Payment made] Remove `Onyx.connect()` for the key: `ONYXKEYS.CONCIERGE_REPORT_ID` in `src/libs/ReportUtils.ts`","user":{"login":"tgolen","id":1228807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjg4MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1228807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen","html_url":"https://github.com/tgolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/events{/privacy}","received_events_ur