 Suspected cause\nExpo background `TaskService` receives a null context or task payload on Android HybridApp when executing a registered background task.\n\n## Reproduction\nUnknown deterministically — see linked Sentry events for Android HybridApp sessions.\n\n## Related\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): none identified\n- Prior GH issues: none\n- Production scan: releases 9.3.89, 9.3.90, 9.3.91 (2026-06-02)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885299179690169\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885299179690169</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061885299179690169</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92089","id":4549386596,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABDyohZA","number":92089,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-06-29] [CFI] [$250] Future-dated card assignments are not supported in New Expensify","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api