 Navigate to Workspace > Company cards\n3. Click on Assign\n4. Choose a card holder\n5. Observe the options\n\n## Expected Result:\nIn New Expensify, card assignments take effect immediately and there is no option to specify a future assignment date.\n\n## Actual Result:\nUsers should be able to schedule/future-date card assignments, similar to the functionality available in Expensify Classic.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff09f8a3-f134-4271-ae1f-9acae5352a33\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060375735002661347\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060375735002661347</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2060375735002661347</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-05</li>\n<li>Automatic offers: </li>\n<ul>\n<li>apeyada | Contributor | 111712171</li>\n</ul></li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/146","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aa