nt Slot Fallback/Default Content Behavior](https://github.com/Avenx-JS/avenx-js/issues/228) | documentation, enhancement, good first issue |\n| 11 | razbuild/raztodo | [[Tests] Add unit tests for `presentation/web/routes/tasks.py`](https://github.com/razbuild/raztodo/issues/43) | help wanted, good first issue, tests |\n| 12 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782) | good first issue, bounty, onboarding |\n| 13 | scikit-hep/vector | [Possibly used before assignment pylint warning](https://github.com/scikit-hep/vector/issues/512) | bug, good first issue, hacktoberfest |\n| 14 | boscorat/openstan | [Admin panel is squashing buttons and fields](https://github.com/boscorat/openstan/issues/73) | good first issue |\n| 15 | speedyk-005/yasbd-lib | [[bug] Com. & Adm. is incorrectly split into two sentences](https://github.com/speedyk-005/yasbd-lib/issues/150) | bug, good first issue, edge-cases |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/146/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/89966","id":4401648180,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABBlvSNA","number":89966,"title":"[$250] Show 'Scanning' date and sort scanning receipts to top of expenses list","user":{"login":"MelvinBot","id":12432488,"node