ent:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Open the Expensify app\n2. Tap the FAB button > Track distance \n3. Tap Odometer\n4. Swipe back\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe Inbox or previous screen is displayed, and the \"Track distance\" screen does not appear or blink.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe \"Track distance\" screen briefly appears after swiping back.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3733a7bc-96be-4e8c-b9f7-f5814efa7406\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7194740\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071697830269476015\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071697830269476015</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2071697830269476015</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94904/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879/events","html_url":"https://github.com/E