ing state and is not displayed. After tapping Send, a separate text + attachment message is created.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33115fb4-5f20-4c34-8d65-30466e4eb79c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7194520\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071637942646065190\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071637942646065190</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2071637942646065190</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94879/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94863","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94863/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94863/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94863/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94863","id":4769175174,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABHEPWhg","number":94863,"title":"[$250] Android - Expense - Device back button on track distance screen lead to previous tab instead of closing it","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":