 Split expense > Manual\n4. Enter amount > Next\n5. On confirmation page, enter 0 on the split input on each participant\n6. Click Merchant\n7. Enter any merchant and save it\n8. Click Split\n\n## Expected Result:\nthe error should still be there and nothing should happens when clicking confirm button.\n\n## Actual Result:\nApp allows splitting when the sum of splits is not equal to the total amount after saving merchant\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7cf0950-ea8c-47e6-a35e-58d72db4c9cf\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070123656711868367\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070123656711868367</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070123656711868367</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94535","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94535/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94535/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94535/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94535","i