id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196","html_url":"https://github.com/abdulrahuman5196","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahuman5196/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.19-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Unable to validate in Prod - Provide reasoning.\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-48584/folder/43918362/105046737/1515174809?sort=%2Bidentifier\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Windows 10 / Chrome, Honor x6b/ Android 16\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Navigate to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Go to Account > Wallet.\n3. Click Add bank account.\n4. Select United States > Next.\n5. Click Connect Manually and complete flow\n6. Go to Account > Profile.\n7. Verify that the Legal Name, Address, and Phone Number entered during the bank flow are now saved\n8. Navigate back to Account > Wallet\n9. Click on the bank account added and select \"Delete\" and confirm\n10. Complete flow for \"Connect manually\" again\n11. Verify that the Legal Name, Address, and Phone Number steps are SKIPPED\n12. Complete the flow to add the bank account\nResult: A Review badge appears after the account is added. Clicking it redirects the user to Confirm Address.\n\n## Expected Result:\nAfter deleting and re-adding the same manually connected US bank account,  the bank account should be added without requiring additional review.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe bank account is added with a \"Review\" badge. When the user clicks the badge, they are redirected to the Confirm Address page.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7452004a-61c8-46f4-99c2-76fa7b13f75d\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7190397\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070019670504880308\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070019670504880308</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070019670504880308</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/A