","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":44,"created_at":"2026-06-25T05:24:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:57:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"nyomanjyotisa","id":73281575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjgxNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73281575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa","html_url":"https://github.com/nyomanjyotisa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nyomanjyotisa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.4.19-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/91196\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** MacBook Air 26.5 Chrome, iPhone 15 iOS 26.5\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Sign in to ND with a new account, selecting \"Manage\" purpose\n2. Create two expenses with the same amount, merchant, category, and date\n3. Navigate to Spend/ Expenses\n4. Click on the first expense, click on the Report field, select Remove from report - violations disappear\n5. Repeat step 4, select the existing report - violations are displayed\n6. Go offline, remove the first expense from the report again - violations disappear\n7. Go online\n\n## Expected Result:\n\"Potential duplicate\" violation is not displayed on the second expense, as the first one was removed from the report\n\n## Actual Result:\n\"Potential duplicate\" violation appears on the second expense online, when the first one was removed from the report offline\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3e33d5-e2f9-4123-b462-bd0cbc8e5b5c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Rizky Gunawan\n> Bug ID: 7190393\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070016297932142772\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070016297932142772</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070016297932142772</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu