 the import flow.)\n7. Complete the import process.\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe CSV should be imported successfully, or the system should provide a specific validation message identifying any issues with the file or mapped fields.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe import fails and displays the generic error:\n\"Please ensure all fields are filled out correctly and try again. If the problem persists, please reach out to Concierge.\"\n\nNo additional information is provided about which field, row, or column is causing the failure.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nThe screenshot for the issue is in Slack [thread](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781894562414879)\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022069053620673593010\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022069053620673593010</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2069053620673593010</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94178/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94072","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94072/labels{/name}","com