":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Sentry\n\nhttps://expensify.sentry.io/issues/APP-EF1\n\n## Impact (snapshot at filing)\n\n- Users (total since first seen): 1,082\n- Events: 1,506\n- Users (last 14d, 9.4.x releases): 481\n- First seen: 2026-06-03\n- Last seen: ongoing\n- Platform: iOS HybridApp\n- App version(s): 9.4.5–9.4.9\n- Affected route(s): various (layout pass during text input render)\n- Mechanism: AppHang\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n\n```\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::yogaNodeMeasureCallbackConnector\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::measureContent\nfacebook::react::MarkdownTextInputDecoratorShadowNode::applyMarkdownFormattingToTextInputState\n-[RCTMarkdownUtils applyMarkdownFormatting:withDefaultTextAttributes:]\n-[MarkdownParser parse:withParserId:]\nfacebook::jsi::WithRuntimeDecorator<T>::createStringFromUtf8\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\n\nMarkdown formatting during Yoga layout measure blocks the main thread for 2+ seconds, triggering an iOS watchdog App Hang.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nUnknown — see Sentry events linked from the Sentry issue.\n\n## Related\n\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): APP-EG9 (similar createStringFromUtf8 hang)\n- Prior GH issues: none\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067265891842535098\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067265891842535098</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2067265891842535098</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-24</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @abzokhattab</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93831/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reas