blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.8-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Y\n**Reproducible in production?:** Y\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @Leeckhart\n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Expensify Bugs](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781260400701829)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Navigate to Workspace > Company Cards.\n2. Create a new CSV Import card feed.\n3. Upload a spreadsheet containing card transaction data with columns such as: Card Last 4, Spender, Merchant, Transaction Currency, Total Amount,  (Missing: Date column)\n4. Complete the import process.\n5. Open the newly created card feed.\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe import process should validate required fields (including Date, if mandatory).\nIf a required column is missing, the system should:\nDisplay a clear validation error, and/or\nPrevent feed creation until the file is corrected.\nIf the file is valid, cards should appear in the feed after import.\n## Actual Result:\nThe CSV feed is created successfully.\nNo cards are added to the feed.\nThe feed displays: “No cards in this feed”\nNo validation error or warning is shown indicating that required data (e.g., Date column) is missing.\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8207f02b-9dc0-4239-ba55-f7d0918299ba\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022066883484768848009\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022066883484768848009</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2066883484768848009</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-30</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93704/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93538","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93538/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93538/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93538/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/93538","id":4657274146,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFZhdIg","number":93538,"title":"[$250] Receiving \"The requested amount has changed\" error when trying to Pay a report","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan","html_url":"https://github.com/m-natarajan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/