th a business account.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efd21c69-9ddf-4035-a9cc-0844429bda0e\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022054384793718888907</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2054384793718888907</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-01</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88464/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88240","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88240/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88240/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88240/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/88240","id":4285267632,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7_a_6w","number":88240,"title":"[$250] Add new concierge message after 30 days of broken card connection","user":{"login":"joekaufmanexpensify","id":54866469,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODY2NDY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54866469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joekaufmanexpensify","html_url":"https://github.com/joekaufmanexpensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j