pi.github.com/users/akinwale/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.2.67-2\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/test-runs/TR-2248/folder/13176710/41236933/1050638396\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Device used:** Android\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Launch the app Expensify\n2. Open any conversation 1:1\n3. Tap on \"+\" and \"Add attachment\"\n4. Tap on the preview \n5. Zoom it and wait for the \"Download icon\" appears\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe user should be able to view the long image in full resolution and zoom in/out clearly, regardless of when the download icon appears.\n\n## Actual Result:\nWhen the download icon finally appears, the long image suddenly becomes blurred and remains low resolution, preventing the user from viewing or zooming the image clearly.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n- [ ] MacOS: Desktop\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57f82aa5-dde2-4327-85f1-aeea7675555e\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/592c8e49-848d-4aae-90c4-55e349664721)\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~021998372578082250221</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 1998372578082250221</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-30</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @akinwale</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66412","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66412/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66412/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66412/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/66412","id":3237324253,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7A9aXd","number":66412,"title":"[Partial payment] Remove `Onyx.connect()` for the key: `ONYXKEYS.SESSION` in `src/libs/ReportUtils.ts`","user":{"login":"tgolen","id":1228807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjg4MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1228807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen","html_url":"https://github.com/tgolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https: