h`, fatal\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n```\nfacebook::react::RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoopTick\n  -> facebook::react::RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoop\n  -> facebook::react::RCTMessageThread::runAsync\n  -> RCT JSThread run loop\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\nRN Fabric/modern scheduler memory corruption or use-after-free on the JS thread during an event-loop tick. Stack is native-only (no app JS frames), so the fix may require a React Native upgrade or platform-team investigation.\n\n## Reproduction\nUnknown deterministically — fires on the RN JS thread under load on HybridApp iOS. See linked Sentry events.\n\n## Related\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): none identified\n- Prior GH issues: none\n- Production scan: releases 9.3.89, 9.3.90, 9.3.91 (2026-06-02)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885259834583946\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885259834583946</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061885259834583946</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expens