RIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:**\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Needs reproduction (Reproduction blocked- Need E card transactions)\n**Reproducible in production?:** Needs Reproduction\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @Getrudygidashang \n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Expensify Bugs](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1782397927750789)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Create a group workspace with an active Expensify Card.\n2. Ensure a user (cardholder) has unreported Expensify Card transactions.\n3. Remove the cardholder from the group workspace.\n4. Observe where the existing card transactions are moved.\n\n## Expected Result:\nUsers with unreported Expensify Card transactions should not be removable from the group workspace.\nExpensify Card transactions should remain under the Company group workspace.\nTransactions should not be reassigned to an individual workspace.\n## Actual Result:\nWhen a cardholder is removed from the group workspace, their Expensify Card transactions are moved to an individual workspace.\nCompany card transactions are no longer retained under the group workspace.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n  