il.com)\n2. Navigate to workspace tab and observe the workspace that has pending join request badge\n\n## Expected Result:\nOwner details should be shown in the pending join request workspace\n\n## Actual Result:\nOwner details is not shown on pending join request workspace\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4924c6da-1256-456e-911f-fc47efbc5fa1\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7190538\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070049338974512618\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070049338974512618</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070049338974512618</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @NicolasBonet</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94550/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653/events","html_url":"https://github.com/E