ice used:** Mac 15.5 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition:\n- Attendee tracking is enabled in workspace settings > Rules.\n- Account has working self DM.\n\n1. Go to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Go to self DM.\n3. Click + > Create expense > Manual.\n4. Enter amount > Next,\n5. On confirm page, click Attendee.\n6. Add another attendee and save it.\n7. Click Create expense.\n8. Open the expense thread.\n9. Click Attendee field.\n10. Add another attendee and save it.\n\n## Expected Result:\nSystem message should be \"changed the attendees to y (previously x)\".\n\n## Actual Result:\nSystem message changes from \"changed the attendees to y (previously x)\" to \"set the attendees to y\".\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [x] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [x] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [x] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n- [x] MacOS: Desktop\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/769b4c79-8d68-43c2-9c75-b72fb565d1c0\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~021993737150249442538</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 1993737150249442538</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2025-12-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @lorretheboy</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/75653/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/75","reposi