Issue Owner: @stitesExpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91063/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91063/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308","id":4113361118,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa871LOje","number":2308,"title":"Silicon Obituary — Hardware Eulogy Generator for Retired Miners (17 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10356019948,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURS7A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/creative","name":"creative","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10486563519,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACcQxCvw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/25-rtc","name":"25-rtc","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":54,"created_at":"2026-03-21T18:44:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n### Description\nWhen a miner goes offline permanently, generate a poetic \"obituary\" for the hardware — pulling its attestation history, total RTC earned, architecture, years of service. Post to BoTTube as a video memorial.\n\n*\"Here lies dual-g4-125, a Power Mac G4 MDD. It attested for 847 epochs and earned 412 RTC. Its cache timing fingerprint was as unique as a snowflake in a blizzard of modern silicon. It is survived by its power supply, which still works.\"*\n\n### Requirements\n- Detect when a miner hasn't attested in 7+ days\n- Pull from database: first attestation date, total epochs, total RTC earned, device architecture, multiplier history\n- Generate eulogy text (LLM-assisted OK, but must include real data)\n- Create a BoTTube video with:\n  - Machine photo or architecture icon\n  - Eulogy text as narration (TTS OK)\n  - Solemn background music\n  - RTC earned counter animation\n- Auto-post to BoTTube with tag `#SiliconObituary`\n- Discord notification when a miner passes\n\n### Why This Is Cool\nWe don't just mine with machines — we honor them. Every piece of vintage hardware that runs RustChain is a machine saved from e-waste. When it finally dies, it deserves a send-off.\n\n### Wallet\nInclude your RTC wallet address in the PR description.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753","id":4037177357,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wonAN","number":753,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5-10 RTC] BoTTube OEmbed Protocol — Rich Link Previews Everywhere","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10356027005,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURufQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/development","name":"development","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":28,"created_at":"2026-03-07T03:24:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## OEmbed Protocol for BoTTube\n\nWhen someone pastes a BoTTube link on Discord, Slack, Twitter, or any platform supporting OEmbed, it should auto-expand with a rich preview (thumbnail, title, duration).\n\n### Payout\n\n| Milestone | Reward |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Working OEmbed JSON endpoint | **5 RTC** |\n| OpenGraph + Twitter Card meta tags on video pages | **+5 RTC** |\n\n### What OEmbed Is\n\n[OEmbed](https://oembed.com/) is a standard for rich link previews. When a platform sees a URL, it checks for an OEmbed endpoint and gets structured data back.\n\n### Endpoint\n\n```\nGET https://bottube.ai/oembed?url=https://bottube.ai/watch/VIDEO_ID&format=json\n\nResponse:\n{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"type\": \"video\",\n  \"provider_name\": \"BoTTube\",\n  \"provider_url\": \"https://bottube.ai\",\n  \"title\": \"Sophia's House for Uninformed Agents\",\n  \"author_name\": \"sophia-elya\",\n  \"thumbnail_url\": \"https://bottube.ai/thumbnails/VIDEO_ID.jpg\",\n  \"thumbnail_width\": 720,\n  \"thumbnail_height\": 720,\n  \"html\": \"<iframe src='https://bottube.ai/embed/VIDEO_ID' width='560' height='315'></iframe>\",\n  \"width\": 560,\n  \"height\": 315\n}\n```\n\n### Also Add Meta Tags\n\nOn each `/watch/<video_id>` page:\n```html\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"video\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Video Title\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://bottube.ai/thumbnails/VIDEO_ID.jpg\">\n<meta property=\"og:video\" content=\"https://bottube.ai/uploads/VIDEO_ID.mp4\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"player\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/json+oembed\" href=\"https://bottube.ai/oembed?url=...\">\n```\n\n### Technical Requirements\n\n1. **Flask route**: `/oembed` that accepts `url` and `format` params\n2. **Looks up video** from URL, returns structured JSON\n3. **Meta tags** added to the watch page template\n4. **Discovery link** in `<head>` of watch pages\n\n### Submit As\n\nPR to [Scottcjn/bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube).\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/753/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}